# .claudeignore
# Prevents the Claude Code agent from indexing or reading large folders,
# saving thousands of tokens of context overhead.

# Version Control
.git/
.gitignore

# Package Manager Directories (Dependencies)
node_modules/
jspm_packages/
bower_components/
venv/
.venv/
env/
.env/
bin/
obj/
pkg/
.pixi/

# Build & Compilation Outputs
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.nuxt/
target/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Caches & System Files
.sass-cache/
.eslintcache
.parcel-cache
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agentic / Helper Artifacts (Prevents agent from reading its own output history)
.gemini/
.claude/
.antigravity/
**/scratch/
**/browser_recordings/
html_artifacts/
task.md
implementation_plan.md
walkthrough.md

# Media & Binary Files
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.svg
*.ico
*.pdf
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
